/// 🔮️ Test-only: production moved to `ToValue`/`FromValue` below (RUNTIME-DEPENDENCY-ELIMINATION-FOR-S-PLUGINS-AND-ARTIFACTS, 26/09/01, tenth-seam pass — see `📓️orderedmap-tenth-seam.md`).
#[cfg(test)]
